s":[710500602]},{"nodeId":710500602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":1284629538,"text":"変わった岩の写真を撮ったって？","nextNodeIds":[710500603]},{"nodeId":710500603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":2995951642,"text":"ぜひ見せてくれ！","nextNodeIds":[710500604]},{"nodeId":710500604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2949428290,"text":"これ…","nextNodeIds":[710500605]},{"nodeId":710500605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":4128414666,"text":"おっと、この写真！さすがフォンテーヌで作られた新たな機種で撮ったものだな、はっきり映っているんだ。","nextNodeIds":[710500606]},{"nodeId":710500606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":2117589162,"text":"前にテスト機を購入したことがあるが、ぼやける写真しか撮れないし、それに一台の写真機を運ぶには二人も必要だ。だから、最後は教令院に置かれて埃をかぶっているだけだ…","nextNodeIds":[710500607,710500608]},{"nodeId":710500607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2639245754,"text":"埃をかぶる…","nextNodeIds":[710500609]},{"nodeId":710500609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":691493106,"text":"そうだよ、俺の一回の食事代だぞ。うん…どうやら新たな機械を購入する必要があるだな。","nextNodeIds":[710500610]},{"nodeId":710500610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":3594376914,"text":"話が逸れてしまったな、どれどれ、この石は…","nextNodeIds":[710500611]},{"nodeId":710500611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":860994210,"text":"うん、これは化石だ！","nextNodeIds":[710500612]},{"nodeId":710500612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2961738298,"text":"化石？","nextNodeIds":[710500613]},{"nodeId":710500613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":1821041858,"text":"そう、それに海洋生物がたくさんいる…面白いよ。璃月には…「林も田野も、広々とした海に呑まれていた」という言葉がある？これのことを言っているのだ。","nextNodeIds":[710500614]},{"nodeId":710500614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":217603498,"text":"層岩巨淵に化石があるということは、これらの生物はかつて短い時間内に地下に埋められたことだ。そのため、骨格がこんな完全に保たれるのだ。","nextNodeIds":[710500615]},{"nodeId":710500615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":4022222042,"text":"そういえば、ここで地震がよく起きるそうだ…これで説明がつくよ、活発な地質活動は化石が形成される必要な条件の一つだ。","nextNodeIds":[710500616]},{"nodeId":710500616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":2154055634,"text":"この地域の古生物の類群の研究に非常に役に立つ…","nextNodeIds":[710500617]},{"nodeId":710500617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":786559714,"text":"でも一枚だけじゃ足りないかも。","nextNodeIds":[710500619]},{"nodeId":710500619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":2652064818,"text":"もしまたこのような化石を発見できたら、写真を撮ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[710500620]},{"nodeId":710500620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2140578234,"text":"何枚撮ればいいの？","nextNodeIds":[710500621]},{"nodeId":710500621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":2134960394,"text":"そうだな、レポートに使うものだから、似た写真は4、5枚あれば十分なはずだ…それじゃあ5枚にしよう。似たような化石の写真を5枚撮ってきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[710500622]},{"nodeId":710500622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2618,"speakerName":"ヘディーヴ","textMapHash":1486130778,"text":"適正価格で買い取るよ…これは大発見だ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710500608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3724863450,"text":"ちょっともったいない…","nextNodeIds":[710500609]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7105006,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_UI","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE